    "Five draws per template were fixed before fitting; all draws and model seeds are reported.",
    "Within each class, draw uniformly among whole-compound allocations matching BOTH original training-compound and training-profile counts.",
    "The test allocation is the complement within exactly the original template's available sample pool.",
    "Both operators must occur in training and testing overall, not necessarily within every class.",
    "All available replicates and text variants of each compound remain on the same side.",
    "Original JH39 source-operator purges remain in force. Exact profile-count matching necessarily keeps JH39 in testing in every draw.",
    "Three-replicate compounds JH5, JH16 and JH41 also have constrained placement; see allocation_constraints.csv.",
    "Operators are not randomized and chemical identities differ between splits: this is a diagnostic, not a causal estimate of operator effect.",
    "The ten splits overlap and the five model seeds are not independent biological replicates. No naive significance test or pooled 215-compound cohort.",
    "No text, modality, architecture, hyperparameter or uncertainty-threshold selection is performed."
